{%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:card-global-title-open{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if block.settings.bmp_use_global_style -%}<div class="bmp-card-global-title">{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:card-global-title-open{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:title-truncate{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bmp_truncate_class = ''
  assign bmp_truncate_setting = block.settings.bmp_truncate_lines
  if block.settings.bmp_use_global_style
    assign bmp_truncate_setting = settings.bmp_card_title_truncate_lines
  endif
  unless bmp_truncate_setting == blank or bmp_truncate_setting == 'none'
    assign bmp_truncate_class = 'bmp-title-clamp bmp-title-clamp--' | append: bmp_truncate_setting
  endunless
-%}
{%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:title-truncate{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:pdp-title-fit-open{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bmp_title_fit_on = false
  if block.settings.bmp_title_autofit and closest.product != blank
    assign bmp_title_fit_len = closest.product.title | strip | size
    if bmp_title_fit_len > 0 and bmp_title_fit_len <= 48
      assign bmp_title_fit_on = true
    endif
  endif
  assign bmp_title_fit_msize = ''
  if block.settings.bmp_use_global_style == false and block.settings.type_preset == 'custom' and block.settings.bmp_font_size_mobile != blank
    assign bmp_title_fit_msize = block.settings.bmp_font_size_mobile
  endif
-%}
{%- if bmp_title_fit_on or bmp_title_fit_msize != blank -%}
  <bmp-title-fit
    class="bmp-title-fit{% if bmp_title_fit_msize != blank %} bmp-title-fit--msize{% endif %}"
    {% if bmp_title_fit_on %}data-bmp-fit{% endif %}
    {% if bmp_title_fit_msize != blank %}style="--bmp-title-size-mobile: {{ bmp_title_fit_msize }}"{% endif %}
  >
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:pdp-title-fit-open{%- endcomment -%}
{% if closest.product == blank %}
  {% assign text = 'placeholders.product_title' | t %}
  {% assign product_title = '<p role="heading" aria-level="3">' | append: text | append: '</p>' %}{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-START:pdp-title-heading{% endcomment %}{%- if block.settings.bmp_heading_tag != blank -%}{%- assign product_title = '<' | append: block.settings.bmp_heading_tag | append: '>' | append: text | append: '</' | append: block.settings.bmp_heading_tag | append: '>' -%}{%- endif -%}{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-END:pdp-title-heading{% endcomment %}
  {% comment %}BMP-HOOK-START:title-truncate{% endcomment %}{% render 'text', fallback_text: product_title, block: block, class: bmp_truncate_class %}{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-END:title-truncate{% endcomment %}
{% else %}
  {% assign product_title = '<p role="heading" aria-level="3">' | append: closest.product.title | append: '</p>' %}{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-START:pdp-title-heading{% endcomment %}{%- if block.settings.bmp_heading_tag != blank -%}{%- assign product_title = '<' | append: block.settings.bmp_heading_tag | append: '>' | append: closest.product.title | append: '</' | append: block.settings.bmp_heading_tag | append: '>' -%}{%- endif -%}{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-END:pdp-title-heading{% endcomment %}
  <a
    class="contents user-select-text"
    ref="productTitleLink"
    href="{{ closest.product.url }}"
  >
    {% comment %}BMP-HOOK-START:title-truncate{% endcomment %}{% render 'text', fallback_text: product_title, block: block, class: bmp_truncate_class %}{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-END:title-truncate{% endcomment %}
  </a>
{% endif %}{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-START:pdp-title-fit-close{% endcomment %}{%- if bmp_title_fit_on or bmp_title_fit_msize != blank -%}</bmp-title-fit>{%- endif -%}{%- if bmp_title_fit_on -%}{%- render 'bmp-title-fit' -%}{%- endif -%}{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-END:pdp-title-fit-close{% endcomment %}
{% comment %}BMP-HOOK-START:card-global-title-close{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if block.settings.bmp_use_global_style -%}</div>{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:card-global-title-close{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  BMP-SCHEMA:card-global-title — the schema JSON below carries a BMP delta:
  one additive bmp_use_global_style checkbox, plus bmp-gated visible_if terms
  appended to the native settings so local controls hide while the block
  follows the global card style (JSON cannot carry Liquid markers).

  The schema carries a SECOND, independent delta announced by the one-line
  comment right below — bmp_truncate_lines. Since 2026-08-17 it
  follows the same mirror pattern as the native settings: hidden while
  bmp_use_global_style is on and replaced by the global
  bmp_card_title_truncate_lines (recorded in the COUNTERPART map of
  scripts/check-card-global-style.mjs). The hook computation reads
  block-or-global through the bmp_truncate_setting alias — the same
  alias-when-off shape as the media ratio in snippets/card-gallery.liquid, so
  the off-state stays identical by construction. The two schema deltas still
  stay separate comments: check-title-truncate.mjs also requires
  its own marker on the line immediately above the schema tag, which only a
  single-line comment can satisfy — keep the two comments apart (which is why
  check-conventions.mjs collects N announcing blocks per file).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  BMP-SCHEMA:pdp-title-fit — additive schema delta: three settings.
  bmp_title_autofit (checkbox, default false, no visible_if so it stays
  reachable in both style modes) engages the one-line auto-fit wrapper emitted
  by BMP-HOOK:pdp-title-fit-open/-close for titles of 1-48 characters.
  bmp_heading_tag (select "", h1, h2, h3, default "" = stock bytes) rebuilds
  the title string as a real heading via BMP-HOOK:pdp-title-heading — the PDP
  needs a literal <h1> the stock <p role="heading" aria-level="3"> cannot give.
  bmp_font_size_mobile (select, same rem option list as native font_size,
  default "") is the block half of the per-device size mirror; its global
  counterpart is bmp_card_title_size_mobile.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}BMP-SCHEMA:title-truncate - additive schema delta: setting id "bmp_truncate_lines" (select: none / 1 / 2 / 3, default "none"), hidden while bmp_use_global_style is on (visible_if) in favour of the global counterpart bmp_card_title_truncate_lines; consumed by blocks/product-title.liquid BMP-HOOK:title-truncate (CSS line-clamp in assets/bmp-styles.css){%- endcomment -%}
